      "id": "CVE-2026-73468",
      "publishedDate": "2026-09-16T09:55:17.069Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-09-16T09:55:17.069Z",
      "description": "A specially crafted packet can cause the premature expiry of multicast forwarding state on affected interfaces, potentially resulting in temporary multicast traffic loss during the affected period.",
      "severity": 6.5,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Arista Networks EOS\n🔓 漏洞类型：CWE-670 (CWE-670)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
